                        <div class="metafield-rich_text_field"><p><em><strong>Night Sweats, Overheating, Hot Summers</strong></em></p><ul><li>Enhanced breathability</li><li>Supreme moisture-wicking </li><li>Temperature-Regulation</li><li>QMAX (cool-to-the-touch) Rating: Balanced Cool Feel</li></ul><p><em><strong>Sleep Movers</strong></em></p><ul><li>Engineered to move with you, with less friction and no uncomfortable bunching.</li></ul><p><em><strong>Scratchy Bed Fabric</strong></em></p><ul><li><strong>Athleisure Style Softness</strong>: Designed to feel as comfortable as you feel in your favorite athleisure wear. </li></ul><p><em><strong>Popping Corners</strong></em></p><ul><li><strong>No slip fit:</strong> athletic-grade elastic bands lock sheets firmly in place all night.</li></ul><p><em><strong>Sheet Stealers</strong></em></p><ul><li><strong>Always Covered:</strong> Flat sheets have a generous hang and our signature 4-way stretch ensures that no one ever truly hogs the bedding.</li></ul><p><em><strong>Hard to Buy for Mattresses</strong></em></p><ul><li><strong>Bed Stretch:</strong> Securely fits deep pocket mattresses and adjustable beds without slipping. </li></ul></div>
                      
                    
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div><div class="about">
                <div class="about__accordion-item" >
                  <button
                    class="about__accordion-toggle focus-inset button--unstyled"
                    aria-label="Product Description"
                  >
                    <span class="about__accordion-title">
                      Product Description
                    </span>
                  </button>
                  <div
                    class="about__accordion-description richtext__content"
                    
                  >
                    
                      
                        <div class="metafield-rich_text_field"><p>Balancing cooling and coziness with our signature athleisure-feel texture, Original Performance is the sheet set that started it all. Built to move &amp; stretch with you all night long.</p><p><strong>Key Benefits &amp; Features</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Athleisure-feel softness: </strong>The first sheet set made to feel like your best athleisure wear. Silky, smooth, stretchy, and soft, but unlike any bedding you&#39;ve had before.</li><li><strong>Breathable &amp; Lightweight: </strong>The knit construction encourages airflow and reduces trapped heat for a cooler sleep environment.</li><li><strong>Active moisture-wicking:</strong> Evaporates night sweat instantly.</li><li><strong>No More Trapped Heat:</strong> Breathes 10x better than standard sheets to cool your body naturally</li><li><strong>Stabilizes Temperature:</strong> Eliminates hot-and-cold spikes so you stay asleep until morning</li><li><strong>Calms Irritated Skin:</strong> Friction-reducing performance fabric stops rough sheet chafing.</li><li><strong>Fixes Messy Beds:</strong> Wrinkle-resistant construction keeps your bed smooth with zero effort.</li><li><strong>Durable:</strong> Our strongest sheet set, built to last with our signature 4-way stretch and athletic-grade elastic band.</li><li><strong>Reliable:</strong> 17+ years of product and brand refinement. </li><li><strong>Risk-free: 60-Night guarantee:</strong> if you don&#39;t love the feel, send your sheets back for a full refund. </li></ul></div>
                      
                    
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div><div class="about">
                <div class="about__accordion-item" >
                  <button
                    class="about__accordion-toggle focus-inset button--unstyled"
                    aria-label="Dimensions &amp; Care"
                  >
                    <span class="about__accordion-title">
                      Dimensions &amp; Care
                    </span>
                  </button>
                  <div
                    class="about__accordion-description richtext__content"
                    
                  >
                    
                      
                        <div class="metafield-rich_text_field"><p><strong>Dimensions:</strong><br />
Twin/Twin XL: Mattresses up to 14&quot; deep. </p><p>Includes 1 Flat Sheet, 1 Fitted Sheet, and 1 Pillowcase.</p><ul><li><strong>Fitted Sheet: </strong>80&quot;L x 39&quot;W x 12&quot;</li><li><strong>Flat Sheet: </strong>96&quot;L x 66&quot;W</li><li><strong>Pillowcase: </strong>30&quot;L x 20&quot;W</li></ul><p>Full: Mattresses up to 16&quot; deep</p><p>1 Flat Sheet, 1 Fitted Sheet, and 2 pillowcases.</p><ul><li><strong>Fitted Sheet: </strong>75&quot;L x 54&quot;W x 14&quot;</li><li><strong>Flat Sheet: </strong>96&quot;L x 81&quot;W</li><li><strong>Pillowcases: </strong>30&quot;L x 20&quot;W</li></ul><p>Queen: Mattresses up to 18&quot; deep</p><p>1 Flat Sheet, 1 Fitted Sheet, and 2 pillowcases.</p><ul><li><strong>Fitted Sheet: </strong>80&quot;L x 60&quot;W x 15&quot;</li><li><strong>Flat Sheet: </strong>102&quot;L x 90&quot;W</li><li><strong>Pillowcases: </strong>30&quot;L x 20&quot;W</li></ul><p>King/Cal King: Fits mattresses up to 20&quot; deep</p><p>1 Flat Sheet, 1 Fitted Sheet, and 2 pillowcases.</p><ul><li><strong>Fitted Sheet: </strong>80&quot;L x 78&quot;W x 17&quot;</li><li><strong>Flat Sheet: </strong>102&quot;L x 108&quot;W</li><li><strong>Pillowcases: </strong>40&quot;L x 20&quot;W</li></ul><p>Split King: Mattresses up to 18&quot; deep</p><p>1 Flat Sheet, 2 Fitted Sheets, and 2 pillowcases.</p><ul><li><strong>Fitted Sheet (2): </strong>78&quot;L x 39&quot;W x 15&quot;</li><li><strong>Flat Sheet: </strong>112&quot;L x 108&quot;W</li><li><strong>Pillowcases: </strong>40&quot;L x 20&quot;W<br />
</li></ul><p><strong>Care instructions: </strong>Machine wash cold before use. Wash dark colors separately. Do not use bleach. No dryer sheets or fabric softener. Tumble dry only and remove immediately. Do not dry. Do not dry clean.</p><p><strong>Fabric:</strong> 87% Performance Polyester / 13% Spandex<br />
Athletic-grade Elastic band</p></div>
                      
                    
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div><div class="about">
                <div class="about__accordion-item" >
                  <button
                    class="about__accordion-toggle focus-inset button--unstyled"
                    aria-label="Certifications"
                  >
                    <span class="about__accordion-title">
                      Certifications
                    </span>
                  </button>
                  <div
                    class="about__accordion-description richtext__content"
                    
                  >
                    
                      
                        <div class="metafield-rich_text_field"><h6>OEKO-TEX® Certified</h6><ul><li>Certificate Number: BJ025 254961</li><li>Safe for you and your family: Free from harmful chemicals and substances.</li><li>﻿﻿Eco-friendly: Produced with minimal environmental impact.</li><li>﻿﻿Ethically made: Ensuring fair and safe working conditions throughout the production process.</li></ul></div>
                      
                    
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div></div>
    </div>
