              <span class="sheex-cc__corner-eyebrow">Comfort</span>
              <div class="sheex-cc__corner-body">Soft the moment you slip in, and only softer with every wash.</div><ul class="sheex-cc__features"><li>Buttery hand-feel</li><li>4-way stretch fit</li><li>Deep-pocket tailoring</li></ul></div><div >
              <span class="sheex-cc__corner-eyebrow">Hygiene</span>
              <div class="sheex-cc__corner-body">Performance fibers that dry fast and resist the buildup traditional cotton traps.</div><ul class="sheex-cc__features"><li>Quick-drying weave</li><li>Odor-resistant</li><li>Machine wash + tumble dry</li></ul></div></div>

