  <div class="sheex-fq__inner">
    <div><span class="sheex-fq__eyebrow">FAQ</span><div class="sheex-fq__heading">Questions, answered honestly.</div>
    </div><div class="sheex-fq__list"><details
            class="sheex-fq__item"
            data-block-id="faq_item_mHr8kw"
            id="cooling"
            open
            
          >
            <summary>
              <span class="sheex-fq__question">How do SHEEX sheets actually cool you down?</span>
              <span class="sheex-fq__icon"></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="sheex-fq__answer"><p>Our performance knit pulls moisture from your skin and disperses it across a larger surface area, allowing heat to evaporate faster than traditional cotton. The result: a consistently cool sleep surface.</p></div>
          </details><details
            class="sheex-fq__item"
            data-block-id="faq_item_hNrK79"
            id="60-night-guarantee"
            
            
          >
            <summary>
              <span class="sheex-fq__question">What's the 60-night guarantee?</span>
              <span class="sheex-fq__icon"></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="sheex-fq__answer"><p>Sleep on your SHEEX for 60 nights. If they aren't the most comfortable sheets you've ever owned, we'll refund every dollar, no questions asked.</p></div>
          </details><details
            class="sheex-fq__item"
            data-block-id="faq_item_JF83WN"
            id="washing"
            
            
          >
            <summary>
              <span class="sheex-fq__question">How do they hold up after washing?</span>
              <span class="sheex-fq__icon"></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="sheex-fq__answer"><p>Unlike cotton that softens then breaks down, our performance fibers retain their softness and shape for years. Machine wash cold, tumble dry low.</p></div>
          </details><details
            class="sheex-fq__item"
            data-block-id="faq_item_HX4ndz"
            id="deep-mattress"
            
            
          >
            <summary>
              <span class="sheex-fq__question">Will they fit a deep mattress?</span>
              <span class="sheex-fq__icon"></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="sheex-fq__answer"><p>Yes. Our fitted sheets stretch comfortably over mattresses up to 18 inches deep, including hybrid and pillow-top constructions.</p></div>
          </details><details
            class="sheex-fq__item"
            data-block-id="faq_item_chJbLf"
            id="collections"
            
            
          >
            <summary>
              <span class="sheex-fq__question">What's the difference between the SHEEX collections?</span>
              <span class="sheex-fq__icon"></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="sheex-fq__answer"><p>Each SHEEX sheet set has a slightly different feel and is designed to address different sleep needs. View our comparison chart to find the best sheet set for you.</p></div>
          </details></div></div></section>

<script>
  (function () {
    var section = document.getElementById('sheex-fq-template--23112337260682__faq_WRNGXm');
    if (!section) return;

    function openPopup(blockId) {
      var overlay = section.querySelector('[data-popup-overlay="' + blockId + '"]');
      var popup = section.querySelector('[data-popup="' + blockId + '"]');
      if (!overlay || !popup) return;

      overlay.classList.add('is-open');
      popup.classList.add('is-open');
      overlay.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');
      popup.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');
      document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
    }

    function closePopup(blockId) {
      var overlay = section.querySelector('[data-popup-overlay="' + blockId + '"]');
      var popup = section.querySelector('[data-popup="' + blockId + '"]');
      if (!overlay || !popup) return;

      overlay.classList.remove('is-open');
      popup.classList.remove('is-open');
      overlay.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
      popup.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
      document.body.style.overflow = '';
    }

    function closeAllPopups() {
      section.querySelectorAll('.sheex-fq-popup.is-open').forEach(function (p) {
        closePopup(p.getAttribute('data-popup'));
      });
    }

    section.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var link = e.target.closest('a[href="#popup"]');
      if (!link) return;

      var item = link.closest('.sheex-fq__item');
      if (!item) return;

      var blockId = item.getAttribute('data-block-id');
      if (!blockId) return;

      e.preventDefault();
      openPopup(blockId);
    });

    section.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var closeBtn = e.target.closest('[data-popup-close]');
      if (closeBtn) {
        e.preventDefault();
        closePopup(closeBtn.getAttribute('data-popup-close'));
        return;
      }

      var overlay = e.target.closest('[data-popup-overlay]');
      if (overlay) {
        closePopup(overlay.getAttribute('data-popup-overlay'));
      }
    });

    document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
      if (e.key === 'Escape') closeAllPopups();
    });
  })();
</script>

