    <div id="yotpo-reviews-section-data" style="margin-top:4px; font-size:11px; line-height:1.35; color:#555; max-height:220px; overflow:auto; padding:6px 8px; border:1px solid #eee; border-radius:4px; background:#fafafa;">   <section id="yotpo-reviews-overall-rating">     <p><strong>Overall rating:</strong> 4.735064 / 5 from 6896 reviews.</p>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-ai-summary">     <h3>AI Generated Review Summary</h3>     <p>The Original Performance Sheet Set by SHEEX offers a luxurious, soft, and breathable sleeping experience. Customers praise its ability to stay cool, its perfect fit, and its wrinkle-free design. The high-quality fabric and beautiful colors contribute to a comfortable and restful night's sleep.</p>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-summary-topics">     <h3>Summary topics</h3>     <ul>       <li><span class="yotpo-topic-name">Sheet Comfort</span> (<span class="yotpo-topic-coverage">65%</span>): <span class="yotpo-topic-summary">Many customers loved these sheets, praising their comfort, easy maintenance, and ability to be washed.</span></li><li><span class="yotpo-topic-name">Fabric Quality</span> (<span class="yotpo-topic-coverage">2%</span>): <span class="yotpo-topic-summary">Customers appreciated the fabric, describing it as fantastic, amazing, soft, comfortable, and remarkable.</span></li><li><span class="yotpo-topic-name">Sleep Quality</span> (<span class="yotpo-topic-coverage">7%</span>): <span class="yotpo-topic-summary">Customers appreciated the comfort and quality of the Sheex sheets, making them the best on the market.</span></li><li><span class="yotpo-topic-name">Coolness Throughout Night</span> (<span class="yotpo-topic-coverage">3%</span>): <span class="yotpo-topic-summary">Customers raved about how the Sheex sheets stayed cool throughout the night, providing a comfortable sleep.</span></li><li><span class="yotpo-topic-name">Sheet Fit</span> (<span class="yotpo-topic-coverage">6%</span>): <span class="yotpo-topic-summary">Customers expressed appreciation for the perfect fit of the product, which was mentioned multiple times in the reviews.</span></li>     </ul>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-review-topics">     <p><strong>Review topics:</strong> [&quot;color&quot;,&quot;fit&quot;,&quot;size&quot;,&quot;problem&quot;,&quot;feel&quot;,&quot;shipping&quot;,&quot;quality&quot;,&quot;work&quot;,&quot;weight&quot;,&quot;look&quot;,&quot;packaging&quot;,&quot;service&quot;,&quot;material&quot;,&quot;design&quot;,&quot;value&quot;,&quot;price&quot;,&quot;deal&quot;,&quot;fabric&quot;,&quot;comfort&quot;,&quot;experience&quot;,&quot;customer service&quot;,&quot;husband&quot;,&quot;softness&quot;,&quot;use&quot;,&quot;temperature&quot;,&quot;corners&quot;,&quot;cover&quot;,&quot;set&quot;,&quot;texture&quot;,&quot;wife&quot;].</p>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-highlights">     <h3>Review highlights</h3>     <ul>       <li><span class="yotpo-highlight-text">&quot;These sheets are amazing!&quot;</span> &mdash; <span class="yotpo-highlight-author">Jazz D.</span></li><li><span class="yotpo-highlight-text">&quot;Great quality sheets - love the feel and the color.&quot;</span> &mdash; <span class="yotpo-highlight-author">Celeste S.</span></li><li><span class="yotpo-highlight-text">&quot;These sheets are so soft and comfortable.&quot;</span> &mdash; <span class="yotpo-highlight-author">Susan A.</span></li>     </ul>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-individual-reviews">     <h3>Reviews</h3>     <article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Connie P." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Strange Color Combination Included</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;We love SHEEX and have purchased many sets. Unfortunately this latest purchase included two different colors. The fitted sheet was the ordered color while the pillowcases and flat sheet were a different color. We did not return as husband thought they were ordered that way, thus he washed before I noticed the issue.&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Connie P.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Scott P." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">A-Z Amazing</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;This is set #6 between King &amp; Queen sets.   The newest Limoncello color is delightful.  Same incredible cooling comfort and warmth.&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Scott P.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="DeLania M." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">The most comfortable set of</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;The most comfortable set of sheets I ever owned. The quality is amazing as well.&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">DeLania M.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Barbara J." data-rating="4">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">I have had sheex for</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;I have had sheex for over a decade and love them. But it was time for a new set. The new set doesn't seem as nice as the old but perhaps i have to break it in. one dissapointment, I received the sheet set but not the pillow cases to match. I bought a seperate set of cases which I received, but shouldn't I have received the pillowcases that match the sheex set?&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Barbara J.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">4/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="L" data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title"></h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;Love my sheets very luxurious and it&rsquo;s cooling sheets when you get hot these are the best sheets ever&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">L</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Hope P." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">I have never had a</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;I have never had a set of sheets that feels this amazing!&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Hope P.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Marilyn L." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Love these sheets!</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;This is our second set of Sheex sheets. They are so delightfully comfortable to sleep on. And it is very easy to put them on the bed because they stretch in every direction.&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Marilyn L.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Tamara" data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title"></h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;Wow first set of sheets ever to comepletly stay on my bed&hellip;. . top and bottom! Neither need to be tucked in of a morning and i DONT BURN UP @ night! Love the size of the top sheet because it is plenty big enough to go all the way down my 20&rdquo; mattress! No more tug and pull with my husband trying to stay under the sheet 🙌🏼 hands down best set of sheets ever #1&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Tamara</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Colton" data-rating="1">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title"></h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;Bought these sheets because both the wife and I sleep hot so we were looking for sone cooler sheets. These are provably tge hottest sheets ive ever had. They literally made us both sweat profusely. I will say theyre comfortable as far as feel but they should be advertised as heating sheets.&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Colton</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">1/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Derrick" data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title"></h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;Best sheets ever! 15 plus years now.&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Derrick</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-qa">     <h3>Q&amp;A</h3>     <dl>       <dt class="yotpo-qa-question">Is the split King 2 twin fitted sheets and a king cover sheet. I just want to make sure I am ordering the correct item before I make the purchase. We have a king adjustable bed.</dt><dd class="yotpo-qa-answer">Yes, that is correct</dd><dt class="yotpo-qa-question">I was wondering if the original performance queen sheet works well for mattresses on an adjustable base?</dt><dd class="yotpo-qa-answer">SHEEX fabrics are THE BEST sheets on the market for adjustable bases. Our fabric has a unique 4-way-stretch with athletic grade elastic around the entire fitted sheet so your bedding stays where it should! Enjoy your new queen sheets!</dd><dt class="yotpo-qa-question">what fabric is the sheex made from</dt><dd class="yotpo-qa-answer">SHEEX are made from our unique athletic fabric inspired performance poly &amp;amp; spandex. They are amazing so give them a try! They come with a 30-Night Guarantee! Sleep great!</dd><dt class="yotpo-qa-question">what are the dimensions of the king bed sheet and king pillow case?</dt><dd class="yotpo-qa-answer">Hi! Measurements for our king sheet sets &amp;amp; pillowcases are:  Fitted Sheet: 76&amp;quot; W x 80&amp;quot; L  Pocket Depth: 18&amp;quot; Flat Sheet: 76&amp;quot; W x 80&amp;quot; L King Pillowcase Pair: 20&amp;quot; W x 36&amp;quot; L SLEEP GREAT on your new SHEEX Sheets!</dd><dt class="yotpo-qa-question">Before spending so much on sheets I need to know how much of the &ldquo;top&rdquo; (not the fitted) sheet gets tucked up under the mattress on the end, can&rsquo;t stand sheets that come untucked and your feet stick out. These would be for a regular king bed. I understand they stretch but you can&rsquo;t stretch and hold sheets when you&rsquo;re sleeping.</dt><dd class="yotpo-qa-answer">Our original performance has a very generous amount of fabric for every st. they are designed for deep pockets and should not be an issue with tucking in and exposing your feet.</dd>     </dl>   </section> </div>
  



</div>
</div>


