eridian Blue Limited Edition Color Original Performance Sheet Set. #choose-your-color_meridian-blue","id":33528449663114,"position":61,"preview_image":{"aspect_ratio":1.0,"height":750,"width":750,"src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_OP-SheetSets-MeridianBlue-3.jpg?v=1787583711"},"aspect_ratio":1.0,"height":750,"media_type":"image","src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_OP-SheetSets-MeridianBlue-3.jpg?v=1787583711","width":750},{"alt":"Meridian Blue Limited Edition Color Original Performance Sheet Set. #choose-your-color_meridian-blue","id":33528449302666,"position":62,"preview_image":{"aspect_ratio":1.0,"height":750,"width":750,"src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_OP-SheetSets-MeridianBlue-4.jpg?v=1787583711"},"aspect_ratio":1.0,"height":750,"media_type":"image","src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_OP-SheetSets-MeridianBlue-4.jpg?v=1787583711","width":750},{"alt":"Meridian Blue Limited Edition Color Original Performance Sheet Set. #choose-your-color_meridian-blue","id":33528449532042,"position":63,"preview_image":{"aspect_ratio":1.0,"height":750,"width":750,"src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_OP-SheetSets-MeridianBlue-5.jpg?v=1787583711"},"aspect_ratio":1.0,"height":750,"media_type":"image","src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_OP-SheetSets-MeridianBlue-5.jpg?v=1787583711","width":750}],"requires_selling_plan":false,"selling_plan_groups":[],"content":"\u003cp\u003ePut an end to over-heating and other sleep-disrupting temperature fluctuations and start getting the great night’s sleep your body needs to perform at its peak.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur luxurious, ridiculously soft sheet sets breathe 10x better than traditional cotton sheets, which helps minimize night sweats. Plus, our lightweight fabrics allow your body to cool itself naturally, so you can put an end to sleep-disrupting temperature fluctuations.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLet SHEEX Own the Night®, so you can own your day.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFabric: \u003c\/strong\u003e87% Performance Polyester \/ 13% Spandex\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProudly Designed in the USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImported\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e*All promo codes have now been applied to this product.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e"},
    productCollections: [{"id":95778013255,"handle":"best-sellers","updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:02:45-05:00","published_at":"2019-09-04T13:22:07-04:00","sort_order":"manual","template_suffix":"best-sellers-collection","published_scope":"global","title":"Best Sellers - Bedding \u0026 Sleepwear","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFind our best-selling bedding and sleepwear with thousands of top-rated, 5-star reviews here! We're so sure you'll love our Ridiculously Soft®, moisture-wicking fabrics, we'll let you try them for 60-Nights, risk-free.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","image":{"created_at":"2021-01-14T00:34:17-05:00","alt":"Woman sleeping in SHEEX bedding and sleepwear","width":2000,"height":1234,"src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/collections\/Best_Sellers.jpg?v=1743707891"}},{"id":260627300490,"handle":"breathable-bed-sheets","updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:02:45-05:00","published_at":"2021-04-01T15:13:22-04:00","sort_order":"manual","template_suffix":"default-no-filter","published_scope":"global","title":"Breathable Bed Sheets","body_html":"SHEEX® breathable bed sheets keep you feeling light, comfortable, and cool throughout even the hottest night. Our sheets are built with moisture-wicking technology, ridiculously soft® breathable fabric, and wrinkle-free durability.","image":{"created_at":"2021-04-01T15:13:23-04:00","alt":"Breathable Bed Sheets SHEEX","width":2000,"height":1120,"src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/collections\/SheetSeparates_CollectionImages_1_923d5337-7ed8-46fc-b7af-8fd29a894239.png?v=1793719747"}},{"id":334270333066,"handle":"cooling-sheets-for-kids","updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:02:45-05:00","published_at":"2025-10-27T14:15:48-04:00","sort_order":"best-selling","template_suffix":"kids-cooling-sheets","published_scope":"global","title":"Cooling Sheets for Kids","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eKids need restorative sleep to grow, learn, and feel their best every day. When their nights are disrupted by overheating and sweating, they can wake up groggy and sluggish.\u003cbr\u003ePut an end to nighttime wakeups with SHEEX® cooling bed sheets for kids.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSHEEX® performance fabrics are engineered with cooling technology to keep your child cool, dry, and comfortable all night long. Help them get the deep, uninterrupted sleep they need to thrive.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","image":{"created_at":"2025-10-27T14:27:06-04:00","alt":"SHEEX Colorful Cooling Sheets for Kids","width":1200,"height":867,"src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/collections\/PRIDE-PillowcaseShams_PDP-2.jpg?v=1761589626"}},{"id":334270136458,"handle":"cooling-sheets-for-new-mattresses","updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:02:45-05:00","published_at":"2025-10-27T14:07:14-04:00","sort_order":"manual","template_suffix":"new-mattress-sheets","published_scope":"global","title":"Cooling Sheets for New Mattresses","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eOut with the old, in with the new! Bringing home a new mattress is the perfect time to upgrade your bedding ensemble. SHEEX® temperature-regulating sheets work in tandem with a cooling mattress to keep you cool, dry, and comfortable as you sleep.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUpgrade to SHEEX® and start getting better sleep from day one—guaranteed.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","image":{"created_at":"2025-10-27T14:13:26-04:00","alt":"Cooling Sheets for New Mattresses","width":1800,"height":670,"src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/collections\/100625_PrimeTime_JH_DesktopHero.jpg?v=1761588849"}},{"id":260627366026,"handle":"sheets-for-night-sweats","updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:02:45-05:00","published_at":"2021-04-01T15:12:52-04:00","sort_order":"manual","template_suffix":"night-sweats-sheets","published_scope":"global","title":"Cooling Sheets for Night Sweats","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eNight sweats can mess with your sleep and leave you feeling exhausted, groggy, and frustrated. Break the cycle with the best cooling sheets for night sweats.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEngineered with innovative, moisture-wicking fabrics that breathe 10x better than cotton, SHEEX® cooling sheets for night sweats are modeled after the athletic wear worn by top athletes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSay hello to cool, dry, blissful sleep with SHEEX®—the best wicking sheets for night sweats.\u003c\/p\u003e","image":{"created_at":"2021-04-01T15:12:53-04:00","alt":"The Best Cooling Sheets for Night Sweats","width":2000,"height":1120,"src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/collections\/SheetSeparates_CollectionImages_1.png?v=1761588888"}},{"id":95777521735,"handle":"cooling-sheets","title":"Cooling Sheets Sets \u0026 Separates","updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:02:45-05:00","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSHEEX® cooling bed sheets keep you cool, dry, and comfortable throughout the night with moisture-wicking technology, Ridiculously Soft® fabric, and wrinkle-free durability. The difference comes down to how that cooling feels—some styles offer an instant cool-to-the-touch sensation, while others focus on breathable, temperature-regulating comfort that keeps you cool over time. Find a sheet set that feels like it was made just for you! Take our quick and easy \u003ca data-fpl-component=\"primitive\" href=\"https:\/\/www.sheex.com\/pages\/sleep-fit-quiz\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eSLEEP•FIT® Quiz\u003c\/a\u003e and sleep cooler with SHEEX®.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2019-09-04T13:21:49-04:00","sort_order":"manual","template_suffix":"cooling-sheet-sets","disjunctive":false,"rules":[],"published_scope":"global","image":{"created_at":"2019-10-29T06:33:58-04:00","alt":"Cooling Sheets - Original Performance Sheet in Graphite","width":1000,"height":500,"src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/collections\/LP_All-ThinSheetSets_2d6174b6-8740-43cb-bfa6-d820b8ac64ab.jpg?v=1761259623"}},{"id":349427302538,"handle":"cooling-sheet-sets-and-separates","title":"Cooling Sheets Sets and Separates","updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:02:45-05:00","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSHEEX® cooling bed sheets keep you cool, dry, and comfortable throughout the night with moisture-wicking technology, Ridiculously Soft® fabric, and wrinkle-free durability. The difference comes down to how that cooling feels—some styles offer an instant cool-to-the-touch sensation, while others focus on breathable, temperature-regulating comfort that keeps you cool over time. Find a sheet set that feels like it was made just for you! Take our quick and easy \u003ca data-fpl-component=\"primitive\" href=\"https:\/\/www.sheex.com\/pages\/sleep-fit-quiz\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eSLEEP•FIT® Quiz\u003c\/a\u003e and sleep cooler with SHEEX®.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-05-19T14:51:30-04:00","sort_order":"manual","template_suffix":"new-cooling-sheet-set","disjunctive":false,"rules":[],"published_scope":"global","image":{"created_at":"2026-05-19T14:39:34-04:00","alt":"Cooling Sheets - Original Performance Sheet in Graphite","width":1000,"height":500,"src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/collections\/LP_All-ThinSheetSets_6c3811fa-e00c-450c-8049-18b28873d3aa.jpg?v=1779215974"}},{"id":320498565258,"handle":"king-cooling-sheets","updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:02:45-05:00","published_at":"2025-01-22T13:55:30-05:00","sort_order":"manual","template_suffix":"king-cooling-sheets","published_scope":"global","title":"King Cooling Sheets","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCheck out SHEEX Cooling Sheet Sets in King Sizes.  Our breathable and temperature regulating sheets are perfect for sweaty sleepers. Guaranteed to help you sleep better or your money back.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","image":{"created_at":"2025-05-21T20:15:30-04:00","alt":"King-Cooling-Sheets SHEEX","width":913,"height":500,"src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/collections\/image_21.png?v=1784573198"}},{"id":260458578058,"handle":"moisture-wicking-and-cooling-bed-sheets","title":"Moisture Wicking and Cooling Bed Sheets","updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:02:45-05:00","body_html":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSHEEX® moisture wicking sheets keep you in cool, dry comfort throughout the night with SLEEP•TECH® Technology our ridiculously soft® fabric, and wrinkle-free durability guarantees a more restorative night's sleep.\u003c\/span\u003e","published_at":"2026-11-03T10:28:56-05:00","sort_order":"manual","template_suffix":"default-no-filter","disjunctive":false,"rules":[],"published_scope":"global","image":{"created_at":"2021-03-04T13:29:11-05:00","alt":"Moisture-Wicking-and-Cooling-Bed-Sheets SHEEX","width":1000,"height":500,"src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/collections\/LP_All-ThinSheetSets_91365303-bf5a-45ea-950b-8789f261c608.jpg?v=1784573167"}},{"id":150952870026,"handle":"original-performance","updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:02:45-05:00","published_at":"2019-09-30T14:51:01-04:00","sort_order":"manual","template_suffix":"default-filter-021626","published_scope":"global","title":"Original Performance Bedding Collection","body_html":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSHEEX® performance bedding brings our innovative cooling and moisture-wicking technology to everything you need for a great night's sleep, including sheets, sheet sets, comforters, pillowcases, and more.\u003c\/span\u003e","image":{"created_at":"2020-01-31T13:39:51-05:00","alt":"Original Performance Bedding in Bedroom Environment","width":2000,"height":1120,"src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/collections\/OP-GarnetSheetSet-V3.jpg?v=1632248276"}},{"id":306537824394,"handle":"queen-cooling-sheets","title":"Queen Cooling Sheets","updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:02:45-05:00","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out SHEEX Cooling Sheet Sets in Queen Sizes.  Our breathable and temperature regulating sheets are perfect for sweaty sleepers. Guaranteed to help you sleep better or your money back.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-05-07T14:00:15-04:00","sort_order":"manual","template_suffix":"queen-cooling-sheets","disjunctive":false,"rules":[],"published_scope":"global","image":{"created_at":"2024-05-09T11:56:06-04:00","alt":null,"width":1200,"height":867,"src":"\/\/www.sheex.com\/cdn\/shop\/collections\/cooling_sheets_queen_bed.jpg?v=1715708946"}},{"id":342643900554,"handle":"sheet-sets","updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:02:45-05:00","published_at":"2026-02-04T12:36:22-05:00","sort_order":"manual","template_suffix":"sheet-set-collection","published_scope":"global","title":"Sheet Sets","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eSHEEX sheet collections are designed for anyone searching for the best cooling sheets for hot sleepers. Our breathable, moisture-wicking, temperature-regulating bed sheets combine luxury softness with all-night comfort—so you can sleep cooler, wake up refreshed, and finally love your bedding again.\u003c\/p\u003e"},{"id":333244399754,"handle":"sheets-made-for-adjustable-base-beds","updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:02:45-05:00","published_at":"2026-08-26T16:04:08-04:00","sort_order":"manual","template_suffix":"sheets-for-adjustable-bas","published_scope":"global","title":"Sheets Made for Adjustable Base Beds - We End the Corner Pop with our 4-Way Stretch","body_html":"\u003cdiv data-label=\"Row\" data-key=\"row\" data-atomgroup=\"row\" id=\"r-1696448303440\" class=\"gf_row\" data-icon=\"gpicon-row\" data-id=\"1696448303440\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12\" id=\"c-1696448303437\" d